    "Click the + button. Click anywhere outside the Take to save. That's the whole capture flow." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klik på +-knappen. Klik et vilkårligt sted uden for Take for at gemme. Det er hele optageflowet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klicke auf die Taste +. Klicke außerhalb des Takes, um zu speichern. So einfach läuft das Erfassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Haz clic en el botón +. Haz clic en cualquier lugar fuera del Take para guardar. Eso es todo el flujo de captura."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klikkaa +-painiketta. Tallenna klikkaamalla mitä tahansa kohtaa Take:n ulkopuolella. Siinä on koko tallennusprosessi."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cliquez sur le bouton +. Cliquez n’importe où en dehors du Take pour enregistrer. C’est tout le processus de capture."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Fai clic sul pulsante +. Fai clic in un punto qualsiasi fuori dal Take per salvarlo. È tutto qui."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "「＋」ボタンをクリックし、Takeの外側をクリックして保存します。これだけで記録できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "+ 버튼을 클릭하세요. Take 바깥을 아무 곳이나 클릭하면 저장됩니다. 이것으로 캡처가 끝납니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klikk på +-knappen. Klikk hvor som helst utenfor Take-en for å lagre. Det er hele prosessen for å notere noe."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klik op de knop +. Klik ergens buiten de Take om op te slaan. Zo leg je iets vast."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Kliknij przycisk +. Kliknij w dowolnym miejscu poza Take, aby zapisać. To cały proces notowania."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Clique no botão +. Clique em qualquer lugar fora do Take para salvar. Esse é todo o fluxo de captura."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Clique no botão +. Clique em qualquer lugar fora do Take para guardar. É todo o fluxo de captura."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Klicka på +-knappen. Klicka var som helst utanför Taken för att spara. Så enkelt är det att skapa en Take."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "คลิกปุ่ม + คลิกที่ใดก็ได้นอก Take เพื่อบันทึก นี่คือขั้นตอนการบันทึกทั้งหมด"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "+ düğmesine tıklayın. Kaydetmek için Take'in dışında herhangi bir yere tıklayın. Tüm yakalama akışı bundan ibarettir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "点击 + 按钮。点击 Take 以外的任意位置即可保存。记录流程就是这么简单。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "點一下「+」按鈕，再點 Take 以外的任何地方即可儲存。擷取就是這麼簡單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the circle beside any Take to make it a task, set a reminder, or make it important." : {
